                "normalized_text_sha256": "508969ff6f99a2dd17fd053041940ce3e97b618b296ec04b4d179bfb8266fefd"
            },
            "text": "G: I could not sleep at all. The room next door was so noisy.\nR: I understand, and I am very sorry to hear about this. That must have been very frustrating.\nG: It was terrible.\nR: I sincerely apologise for the inconvenience. Let me fix this for you right away. I will move you to a quieter room on a higher floor immediately.\nG: Okay, thank you.\nR: As an apology, we would also like to offer you a complimentary breakfast. I will personally check later to make sure everything is now to your satisfaction.\nG: I really appreciate that.\nR: Thank you for your patience, and again, my sincere apologies.",
            "type": "paragraph"
        },
